                        "review": "I thought this was gonna be a cute little cooking game. Yeah… no\nYou start off thinking it’s gonna be easy, and 5 minutes later everything’s on fire, the kitchen’s moving and nobody knows what’s going on\nPlaying with someone makes it 10x funnier bc you either work together like a dream or end up blaming each other for everything\nIt’s chaotic, ridiculously fun n somehow you always end up saying “one more level” n playing for another 3 hours\nDefinitely recommend it, especially if u wanna test your friendship or ur relationship",
